{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52105","headline":"四言曲池酺饮座铭 · 张後胤","name":"四言曲池酺饮座铭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"公侯盛集，酺醼梁园。\n鸎多谷响，树密花繁。\n波流东逝，落照西奔。\n人生行乐，此外何论。\n（《翰林学士集》）（按：此诗原署「燕王友张後胤」。\n张步云《唐代逸诗辑存》收入。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张後胤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52105.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52105","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}